-- Every MacBook Apple has made, with its model number (the A-number on the
-- bottom case), so they can be picked on Check In, Appointments and Prices.
-- Mirrors MACBOOK_SEED in lib/price-seed.js, which ensureSchema() (lib/db.js)
-- also applies. No prices: they are added from Settings -> Repair prices.
--
-- ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, so re-running never resurrects a deleted model or
-- undoes a rename made in the app.
ON CONFLICT (model_key) DO NOTHING;
